hor">哒公仔</p>\n <p>拓荒者一路向前</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/92520.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">罗挽青</p>\n <p>红楼：荣国府姨娘致富日常</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/57473.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">云霓</p>\n <p>四合如意</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/25997.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">一吨大苹果</p>\n <p>在魔幻都市模拟人生的日子</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class="box">\n <div class="title"><a href="/top/goodnum/">热门收藏</a></div>\n <div class="vote">\n <a href="/shu/93531.html">\n <span class="layui-badge">1</span>\n <img src="https://img.110txt.com/93531/1784652.jpg" alt="恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场">\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p>\n <p class="intro" style="display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 4;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;">沈棠一觉醒来穿成了三百斤的大胖子，却拥有五个绝色兽夫。\n美艳红狐，霸道黑豹，阴郁白蛇，人鱼暴君，硬汉金鹰上将……各个宽肩窄腰大长腿，八块腹肌堪比男模！\n原主又丑又懒遭人嫌，兽夫们避如蛇蝎，她还妄图霸王</p>\n </a>\n </div>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/257.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-orange">2</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生：天王巨星</p>\n <p class="author">楼下赫本</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/292.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-green">3</span>\n <p class="bookname">人在原神，我真的不是无惨</p>\n <p class="author">带面具的柴犬</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/745.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-blue">4</span>\n <p class="bookname">符师不羡仙</p>\n <p class="author">傍晚四时</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/950.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-cyan">5</span>\n <p class="bookname">我的技能有特效</p>\n <p class="author">林跖</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1030.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">6</span>\n <p class="bookname">天朝仙吏</p>\n <p class="author">六戏</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/361.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">7</span>\n <p class="bookname">许你盛